---
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
import { planes, waLink } from '../data/site';
---
<section id="planes" class="alt">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head center rv">
      <span class="eyebrow">Planes</span>
      <h2>Renta mensual, <span class="grad-text">sin plazos forzosos</span></h2>
      <p>Elige el plan según el tamaño de tu taller. Precios en MXN, más IVA. Cancela cuando quieras.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid g3 plans">
      {planes.map((p, i) => (
        <article class:list={['plan', 'rv', { hot: p.destacado, 'glow-border': p.destacado }]} style={`--d:${i * 0.1}s`}>
          {p.destacado && <span class="ribbon">Más popular</span>}
          <h3>{p.nombre}</h3>
          <p class="desc">{p.desc}</p>
          <div class="price"><sup>$</sup><b>{p.precio.toLocaleString('es-MX')}</b><span>/mes</span></div>
          <ul>
            {p.items.map((it) => <li><Icon name="check" />{it}</li>)}
          </ul>
          <a class:list={['btn', p.destacado ? 'btn-primary' : 'btn-ghost']} href={waLink(`Hola, me interesa el plan ${p.nombre} de AutoNexus.`)} target="_blank" rel="noopener">Contratar {p.nombre}</a>
        </article>
      ))}
    </div>
    <p class="note rv">¿Prefieres comprar la licencia o necesitas algo a la medida? <a href="#contacto">Cuéntanos tu caso</a>.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .alt { background: linear-gradient(180deg, transparent, rgba(11,18,32,.9) 20%, rgba(11,18,32,.9) 80%, transparent); }
  .plans { align-items: stretch; }
  .plan { position: relative; display: flex; flex-direction: column; padding: 34px 28px; border-radius: 22px; border: 1px solid var(--line); background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,.05), rgba(255,255,255,.015)); backdrop-filter: blur(10px); }
  .plan.hot { background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(59,130,246,.16), rgba(255,255,255,.02)); box-shadow: 0 30px 80px -30px rgba(59,130,246,.6); }
  .ribbon { position: absolute; top: -13px; left: 50%; translate: -50% 0; padding: 5px 16px; border-radius: 99px; font: 600 .75rem var(--font-h); color: #04101f; background: var(--grad); }
  .desc { color: var(--muted); margin-top: 6px; font-size: .95rem; }
  .price { margin: 22px 0; display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 4px; }
  .price sup { font-size: 1.2rem; color: var(--muted); }
  .price b { font: 700 3rem/1 var(--font-h); }
  .price span { color: var(--muted); }
  ul { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0 0 28px; display: grid; gap: 12px; flex: 1; }
  li { display: flex; gap: 10px; align-items: flex-start; font-size: .94rem; color: #cbd5e1; }
  li :global(svg) { width: 18px; height: 18px; color: var(--green); flex: none; margin-top: 3px; }
  .note { text-align: center; margin-top: 30px; color: var(--muted); }
  .note a { color: var(--cyan); text-decoration: underline; }
</style>
